  "description": "## 0.3.0 (2026-10-10)\r\n\r\n### ✨ New Features\r\n\r\n* **Cloudflare WARP while open** (off by default): while YouTube is in the foreground it uses its own per-app VPN through Cloudflare WARP, and goes back to the normal connection in the background. A free WARP device is registered on first use; Android asks for VPN permission once. Useful when the direct connection to YouTube is slow at peak hours.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n* **Settings screen:** the Thread Ripper entry now looks like the official Morphe entries (icon, title only), and its texts are in Traditional Chinese.\r\n\r\nBuilt for YouTube 21.16.256 with Morphe Patches 1.45.0 and Spoof video streams = visionOS. WARP was checked on the phone: VPN up 0.3–0.4 s after a cold start, 40–116 Mbps per range, down on Home and up again on return.",
